  "description": "TCP and UDP clients and servers for .NET with TLS, auto-reconnect, keep-alive, message framing, IPv6 and dual-mode servers, plus an IP and port scanner (ping, host name, NetBIOS, MAC vendor), traceroute, service discovery (mDNS, SSDP, ONVIF), an ONVIF camera client, Wake-on-LAN, an NTP time client and a VNC (RFB) client. Built for ILogger and IHostedService, with OpenTelemetry metrics and traces.",
